  "issue_comments": [
    {
      "body": "One more row in the same class, if you want it in this PR: `SGLANG_ENABLE_LOGITS_PROCESSER_CHUNK` (line 370) is documented with default `false`, but it is now the `deprecated_name` of `SGLANG_ENABLE_LOGPROB_CHUNK`, which is `EnvBoolWithAlias(True)` at `environ.py:1172`. Stale name and inverted default.\n\nIt differs from your three removals in that the alias is still registered, so it would follow the `SGLANG_NSA_*` pattern already used on this page: canonical name in the cell, deprecated alias named in the description.\n\nNot opening a competing PR, this file is yours.\n",
